1
00:00:00,774 --> 00:00:02,744
(Bernadette:)Don't let that sway you.

2
00:00:02,743 --> 00:00:05,943
(Howard:)It's hard not to. They taste so
much better than real berries.

3
00:00:08,248 --> 00:00:09,548
(Stuart:)What's up?

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,050
(Bernadette:)So... we need to talk.

5
00:00:14,888 --> 00:00:17,118
(Emily:)You okay?

6
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:19,621
(Raj:)I think we should talk.

7
00:00:20,994 --> 00:00:22,694
(Stuart:)Is everything okay?

8
00:00:23,763 --> 00:00:26,563
(Bernadette:)Well... you've been
living here a while now.

9
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:28,897
(Sheldon:)I know.
I may sell comic books at work,

10
00:00:28,903 --> 00:00:30,633
(Stuart:)but the real superheroes

11
00:00:30,638 --> 00:00:32,238
(Stuart:)are sitting
right in front of me.

12
00:00:35,475 --> 00:00:37,575
(Penny:)Yeah...

13
00:00:37,578 --> 00:00:40,748
(Howard:)His middle name is David. Go.

14
00:00:41,781 --> 00:00:44,651
(Raj:)Look, I care about you a lot,

15
00:00:44,652 --> 00:00:47,422
(Raj:)but we are very
different people.

16
00:00:47,421 --> 00:00:49,451
(Emily:)Are you breaking up with me?

17
00:00:50,857 --> 00:00:52,587
(Raj:)No, no, I'm just
pointing out that

18
00:00:52,593 --> 00:00:55,693
(Raj:)you're dark on the inside
and I'm dark on the outside.

19
00:00:57,263 --> 00:01:00,033
(Bernadette:)So, anyway,
what I'm trying to say is...

